ce as the chart's repository\nvalue, and the chart composes \"repository:tag\", so every pod was created\nwith an unparseable image and the release never became ready. The local\nscript never hit this because it supplies repository and tag separately\nthrough values-local.yaml.\n\nThe deploy now passes the repository without a tag, preloads the postgres\nimage the way the local script does (kind can only load what Docker\nalready holds), and renders the chart first to assert the exact image\nreferences, so a mistake like this fails in seconds rather than after a\nHelm timeout.","timestamp":"2026-10-15T14:51:33Z","author":{"name":"Khushi Sarawagi","email":"248908730+khushi-infinity@users.noreply.github.com"},"committer":{"name":"Khushi Sarawagi","email":"248908730+khushi-infinity@users.noreply.github.com"}},"repository":{"id":1420674381,"node_id":"R_kgDOVK3FTQ","name":"mediqueue","full_name":"khushi-infinity/mediqueue","private":false,"owner":{"login":"khushi-infinity","id":248908730,"node_id":"U_kgDODtYLug","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/248908730?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khushi-infinity","html_url":"https://github.com/khushi-infinity","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khushi-infinity/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khushi-infinity/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khushi-infinity/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khushi-infinity/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khushi-infinity/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khushi-infinity/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khushi-infinity/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khushi-infinity/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khushi-infinity/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/k